  <Docs>
    <summary>Represents a PDF annotation on a page of a PDF document.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>Represents a PDF annotation on a page of a PDF document.
            This abstract class provides a base implementation for different types of PDF annotations
            such as text (<c>FreeTextAnnotation</c>),
            highlight (<c>HighlightAnnotation</c>) etc</para>
